  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></p><p class=\"p2\">Pawse Wellness is a premium Australian dog supplement brand helping dogs live longer, healthier lives. Our products come in a simple daily crumble - no pills, powders, or fuss - and support calm behaviour, joint health, and long-term vitality.</p><p class=\"p3\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></p><p class=\"p2\">We’re not a typical pet supplement brand. Pawse combines real science with high-quality natural ingredients and a format dogs actually enjoy. We focus on proactive wellness - helping prevent issues, not just fix them.</p><p class=\"p3\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p class=\"p2\">Earn strong commissions on every sale, with higher rates for top performers. With a high AOV and repeat purchase potential, Pawse is built to generate consistent income - not just one-off sales.</p><p class=\"p3\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><p class=\"p2\">Keep it real. Pawse performs best with authentic content - daily routines, “what I give my dog,” transformations, and simple education. Think trust-first, not salesy.</p><p class=\"p3\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p class=\"p2\">We’re building a long-term creator community, not one-off deals. Expect ongoing opportunities, support, and a brand your audience will genuinely feel good about recommending.</p></div></div>",
